# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/world/clues.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@clue lead_lake_breathed
# en: The lake held its breath
name [9bf32e] = 湖屏住了呼吸
# en: In Mistveil the lake froze for one breath and the drowned bell tolled. Whoever keeps the boathouse has heard that shore for years.
text [488b1c] = 雾纱月里，湖面冻结了一口气的工夫，沉钟响了一声。守船屋的人在那片岸边听了许多年。

@clue lead_founders_archive
# en: What the founders wrote
name [7110fd] = 创始者写下了什么
# en: The headmistress told the hall it was nothing. The founders' records in the library archive may disagree, and the Restricted Section keeps what the archive won't.
text [6e77dc] = 校长对全场说那不算什么。图书馆档案库里创始者的记录也许另有说法，而档案库不肯留的东西，禁书区会留着。

@clue lead_maud_friend
# en: Maud lost a friend
name [13ea1d] = 老莫德失去过一个朋友
# en: Old Maud was a student the last time the lake froze, and lost a friend to it. She might tell you more, if she trusts you.
text [9085dd] = 上一次湖面封冻时，老莫德还是这里的学生，她因此失去了一个朋友。如果她信任你，也许会告诉你更多。

@clue lead_man_in_grey
# en: A man in grey
name [44c1ae] = 灰衣人
# en: A man in a grey coat told Kael to open something, or his sister would. Kael knows what. He'll tell someone he trusts.
text [6568f1] = 一个穿灰大衣的男人要凯尔打开某样东西，否则就由他妹妹来。凯尔知道是什么。他会告诉他信任的人。

@clue lead_black_star_dream
# en: A dream of a black star
name [077898] = 黑星之梦
# en: You dreamt of the lake from underneath. Seraphine dreams too, and the observatory sees further than any dream.
text [310e35] = 你梦见了从下方看到的湖。瑟拉芬也做这样的梦，而观星台看得比任何梦都远。

@clue lead_seventh_tower
# en: The seventh tower
name [0db95c] = 第七塔
# en: Seven towers, seven locks. One tower has been locked for a century, and something is kept at the top of it.
text [4f08ee] = 七座塔，七把锁。其中一座塔已锁了一百年，塔顶藏着什么东西。

@clue lead_white_furs
# en: A girl in white furs
name [f6670a] = 白裘少女
# en: A Northern girl has taken a room above the village bakery. Kael went pale when he heard.
text [5dc951] = 一个北方姑娘在村里面包房楼上租了间屋子。凯尔听说后脸都白了。

@clue heard_of_starcalling
# en: A scraped-out word
name [9bfbf7] = 被刮掉的词
# en: One word has been scraped out of the observatory's oldest logs. Students who finished Advanced Astromancy were taught it aloud.
text [90a830] = 观星台最老的日志里，有一个词被刮掉了。修完高等星象学的学生，都是被人当面口授这个词的。

@clue founders_ledger
# en: The razored page
name [68d0a8] = 被割去的一页
# en: The founding year was cut out of the Founders' Ledger with a razor, but the pen's impression survived on the page beneath.
text [dfbf3b] = 《创始者账簿》里建校那一年被人用刀片割掉了，但笔尖的压痕留在了下面那一页上。

@clue knows_founders_seal
# en: The founders' seal
name [44bb6a] = 创始者的封印
# en: Lumenhold was built as a seal: seven towers, seven locks, and a key shaped like a star. Something sleeps beneath the water.
text [934b3b] = 流明堡是作为一道封印建起来的：七座塔，七把锁，还有一把星形的钥匙。有什么东西在水底沉睡。

@clue lake_bell
# en: The bell under the water
name [e5ecdf] = 水下的钟
# en: A drowned bell lies under the lake and tolls when the thing below stirs. A tunnel runs down from the boathouse toward it.
text [8955ef] = 一口沉钟躺在湖底，下面的东西一动，它就会响。一条隧道从船屋一路通向它。

@clue second_shadow
# en: A second shadow
name [ac1374] = 第二道影子
# en: Something small and dark crossed the sky the wrong way and stopped directly above the lake.
text [49214c] = 一个又小又暗的东西逆着方向划过天空，正好停在湖的上方。

@clue seven_locks
# en: Seven locks
name [bb2192] = 七把锁
# en: One lock in each tower; when a tower goes dark, so does its lock. Locks can be mended. They need hands, and a key.
text [8ec40d] = 每座塔里一把锁；一座塔熄了灯，它的锁也就沉寂了。锁可以修补，需要人手，也需要一把钥匙。

@clue star_key
# en: The star key
name [213cd3] = 星钥
# en: A key shaped like a star that holds no light, kept at the top of the seventh tower. The seal can't be renewed without it, or without the founders' words.
text [82437c] = 一把星形的钥匙，不含一丝光，藏在第七塔塔顶。没有它，或者没有创始者的咒文，封印就无法重铸。

@clue kael_family
# en: The Dumonts
name [6f83b6] = 杜蒙家族
# en: Kael's family serve the thing under the lake. They sent him to open its door. He came to stop them.
text [245d59] = 凯尔的家族侍奉着湖底的那个东西。他们派他来打开那扇门。他却是来阻止他们的。

@clue ilse_truth
# en: What Ilse was raised for
name [48407c] = 伊尔泽被养大的目的
# en: The Dumonts raised Kael's sister to open the door if he wouldn't. Nobody ever asked her if she wanted to.
text [6eb048] = 杜蒙家把凯尔的妹妹养大，就是为了在凯尔不肯时由她去开门。从来没人问过她愿不愿意。

@clue codex_names
# en: The Codex of Hollow Names
name [b71797] = 《空洞名录》
# en: A book in the Restricted Section lists everyone the Star has noticed. The last name is still being written, and it is yours.
text [3e42ac] = 禁书区里有一本书，列着所有被那颗星注意到的人。最后一个名字还在写，那是你的名字。

@clue bell_heard
# en: A bell where none is
name [d030c0] = 无人之处的钟声
# en: The drowned bell rang in the night with no one near it, and nobody else woke.
text [233601] = 夜里沉钟响了，附近一个人也没有，而别人都没有醒。

@clue bell_rope
# en: The cut rope
name [581c10] = 被割断的绳
# en: Maud has kept the bell's rope for sixty years. It came up the night the lake froze, cut clean.
text [6af71a] = 老莫德把那口钟的绳子留了六十年。湖面封冻的那一夜它浮了上来，断口齐整。

@clue bell_name
# en: The name on the rim
name [3ef04f] = 钟沿上的名字
# en: Letters run around the bell's rim on the lakebed: a name you don't know, and now keep.
text [05aeb6] = 湖底那口钟的边沿上刻着一圈字母：一个你不认识的名字，如今你记住了。

@clue lead_maud_answer
# en: What Maud knows
name [697576] = 莫德知道的事
# en: Maud has kept the bell's rope for sixty years, and she has promised to tell you who cut it. Go and see her at her cottage.
text [a039ae] = 莫德把那口钟的绳子留了六十年，她答应告诉你是谁割断了它。去她的小屋找她吧。

@clue lead_bell_dive
# en: The diving helmet
name [5a9fa6] = 潜水头盔
# en: There's an old diving helmet in the boathouse. Whatever is written on the bell, you'll only read it from the lakebed.
text [ae5827] = 船屋里有一顶旧潜水头盔。钟上不管写着什么，你只能到湖底去读。

@clue lead_bell_shore
# en: The lakeshore after dark
name [2ebc9e] = 天黑后的湖岸
# en: The bell wants you at the lakeshore after dark, in the evening or at midnight, with what you have: the name from its rim, or Maud's rope.
text [6391ee] = 那口钟要你在天黑后去湖岸，傍晚或午夜都行，带上你手里有的东西：钟沿上的名字，或者莫德的绳子。

@clue black_seal_letters
# en: Letters under a black seal
name [cd05c9] = 黑色火漆的信
# en: House Vaneshade writes to Lyra under its black seal. Her mother asks who beat her, never how she is.
text [9609b0] = 凡妮希德家用黑色火漆给莱拉写信。她母亲只问是谁赢了她，从不问她过得好不好。

@clue lead_moonpetal
# en: The cold that won't leave
thread [fcb8af] = 挥之不去的寒意
# en: Moonpetal
name [676f04] = 月瓣花
# en: Old Maud says the cure is a moonpetal from the Whisperwood, which blooms only after dark, and that you have to fetch it yourself.
text [7cd738] = 老莫德说，解药是低语森林里的一朵月瓣花，只在天黑后开放，而且必须由你亲手去采。

@clue lead_second_timetable
# en: The unsigned note
thread [41bfa1] = 没有署名的字条
# en: A second timetable
name [efd783] = 第二张时间表
# en: Someone slipped a note under your door: the castle has a second timetable, and it starts at midnight. Whoever wrote it knows the passages.
text [631b45] = 有人从你门缝塞进一张字条：城堡还有第二张时间表，从午夜开始。写字条的人熟悉那些暗道。

@clue lead_grisk_jetty
# en: Grisk's parcels
thread [c5fea9] = 格里斯克的包裹
# en: The jetty at midnight
name [8b40af] = 午夜的栈桥
# en: Grisk's arrangement: a parcel collected at the boathouse jetty at midnight, carried to a cobbler's back door in the village by day.
text [6eb586] = 格里斯克的安排：午夜在船屋栈桥取一个包裹，白天送到村里一家鞋匠铺的后门。

@clue lead_silver_key
# en: The silver key
thread [d5ce1e] = 银钥匙
# en: The Restricted Section
name [b1cf8a] = 禁书区
# en: Odile Varn's notebook came with a silver key to the Restricted Section, the locked door at the back of the library. It's yours to use after hours, in the evening or at midnight.
text [b9cf1a] = 奥迪尔·瓦恩的笔记本里夹着一把银钥匙，能打开禁书区——图书馆后面那扇总是锁着的门。闭馆之后，傍晚或午夜，你都可以用它。

@clue lead_restricted_shelves
# en: The silver key
thread [d5ce1e] = 银钥匙
# en: Deeper in the stacks
name [c89789] = 书架深处
# en: You've been inside the Restricted Section once, and there are shelves you didn't reach. The key still works after hours.
text [35d082] = 你进过一次禁书区，还有好些书架没走到。闭馆之后，钥匙依然管用。

@clue lead_codex_open
# en: The silver key
thread [d5ce1e] = 银钥匙
# en: The Codex, left open
name [5cf0da] = 摊开的名录
# en: The Codex of Hollow Names is still lying where it fell in the Restricted Section, open at your name. Sooner or later, someone will notice you've been there.
text [9a9116] = 《空洞名录》还躺在禁书区里它掉落的地方，摊开在写着你名字的那一页。迟早会有人发现你去过那里。

@clue lead_newt_upstairs
# en: The upstairs room
thread [925e4e] = 楼上的房间
# en: A regular at the Newt
name [19371c] = 蝾螈酒馆的熟客
# en: The landlady of the Gilded Newt's upstairs room keeps a jacket for you now. Any night out at the Newt, there's a party upstairs that pays.
text [82f43f] = 镀金蝾螈酒馆楼上房间的老板娘现在给你留着一件外套。哪天夜里去蝾螈酒馆，楼上总有一场付钱的聚会。

@clue lead_sky_championship
# en: The Skyrace team
thread [dc4a0d] = 天空竞速队
# en: The championship
name [b9ac19] = 锦标赛
# en: You made the team. The championship against Thornwick is flown at the flight field later in the year.
text [bc0a04] = 你进了校队。对荆木学院的锦标赛，会在今年晚些时候于飞行场举行。

@clue lead_brace
# en: The captain's charm
thread [7a7935] = 队长的护符
# en: The dummy that hexes back
name [f7da43] = 会回击的假人
# en: An old duelling captain's charm is sewn into the practice dummy, and it throws hexes back. Read the captain's notes, stand Bram's barrage, drill your footwork: then hold firm inside the circle while it empties.
text [764c8f] = 一位老决斗队长的护符缝在练习假人里，它会把恶咒弹回来。读队长的笔记，扛过布拉姆的轰炸，练好步法：然后在圈里站稳，直到护符放空。

@clue lead_quickquill
# en: The quill that talks back
thread [0707e8] = 会顶嘴的羽毛笔
# en: A quill of your own
name [40b795] = 一支属于你的羽毛笔
# en: A spare quill from the Ledger's drying line finishes your sentences, and then invents them. Teach it, give it proper ink and sit a deadline night with it, before the interview where everyone denies everything.
text [675f89] = 纪事报晾稿绳上的一支备用羽毛笔会替你把话写完，然后开始自己编。教它，给它好墨水，陪它熬一个截稿夜，再去做那场人人都矢口否认的采访。

@clue lead_bramble
# en: The seed in your pocket
thread [e1a78b] = 口袋里的种子
# en: A seed that answers back
name [d31014] = 会回嘴的种子
# en: A seed from the Verdant Circle's far bed sprouted in your pocket. Plant it, see it through a cold snap, and quiet the mandrakes around it before the night it bolts.
text [7f51b9] = 青翠社最里头那块苗床的一颗种子在你口袋里发了芽。把它种下，陪它熬过一场寒潮，让周围的曼德拉草安静下来，然后等它疯长的那一夜。

@clue lead_index
# en: Footnote's drawer
thread [f8bf3c] = 脚注的抽屉
# en: The drawer Footnote guards
name [6e005b] = 脚注守着的抽屉
# en: Footnote sits on one catalogue drawer in the library and won't move. Under him is the card for a book eleven years overdue, somewhere on shelves that wander.
text [a87346] = 脚注蹲在图书馆的一个目录抽屉上，怎么也不挪窝。它身下是一本逾期十一年的书的卡片，书在某排会游走的书架上。

@clue lead_rapport
# en: Two taps on the bar
thread [12c408] = 吧台上敲两下
# en: How the landlady does it
name [0fcd25] = 老板娘是怎么做到的
# en: The Newt's landlady taps the bar twice and a fight turns into a laugh. Learn the regulars' stories, stand them a round and work a double shift, and one festival night the room will be yours to hold.
text [5674f8] = 蝾螈酒馆的老板娘在吧台上敲两下，一场架就变成了一阵笑。学会熟客们的故事，请他们喝一轮，上一次双班，总有一个节日夜，整个酒馆会归你镇住。

@clue lead_distil
# en: Pell's oldest drawer
thread [16c158] = 佩尔最老的抽屉
# en: A draught of your own strength
name [90f116] = 一剂“取自本身之力”的药
# en: Pell's oldest drawer holds a recipe for a draught "of your own strength". Count drops with Pell, buy moonwort, try the daughters' shortcut, and then brew it.
text [f815c7] = 佩尔最老的抽屉里有一张配方，是一剂“取自本身之力”的药。跟佩尔数一夜药滴，买月蕨，试试他女儿们的捷径，然后把它熬出来。

@clue lead_tailwind
# en: The jar of wind
thread [4a78a8] = 罐中之风
# en: Wind in a jar
name [aed1d4] = 装在罐子里的风
# en: A jar of wind sits on the courier loft's dead-letter shelf, and someone once flew with it. Find out who, race the gulls and fix the broom that pulls left, then fly a storm delivery across the lake.
text [92c9fa] = 信使阁楼的死信架上有一罐风，从前有人带着它飞过。找出那人是谁，和海鸥比一场，修好那把总往左偏的扫帚，然后在风暴里飞一趟湖上快递。

@clue lead_the_hush
# en: The Hush
thread [510138] = 寂境
# en: The Hush
name [510138] = 寂境
# en: The deepest part of the Whisperwood, past the heartwood, keeps the castle's hours: it wakes only at midnight.
text [d4cf9b] = 低语森林最深处，心木林再往里，守的是城堡的时辰：它只在午夜醒来。

@clue lead_heartwood
# en: The elder oak's gift
thread [e28277] = 古橡的馈赠
# en: A splinter of heartwood
name [539ac3] = 一片心木
# en: The elder oak gave you a splinter of its heartwood. Mir, at the market stall, could carve it into a wand.
text [5f40f3] = 古橡给了你一片它的心木。集市摊子上的米尔能把它雕成一根魔杖。

@clue lead_spinner_silk
# en: The Spinner's silk
thread [53ecf8] = 织网者的丝
# en: A bolt of grey silk
name [e5dad8] = 一卷灰丝
# en: The Spinner gave you a bolt of her silk. The village tailor could make a robe of it.
text [6fd0e6] = 织网者给了你一卷她的丝。村里的裁缝能用它做一件长袍。

@clue lead_missed_round
# en: The missed round
thread [5ab68d] = 漏掉的巡房
# en: The lamp that went out
name [618d37] = 熄灭的灯
# en: Sister Amaranth missed her evening round, the first time anyone can remember. Someone has to keep the infirmary going until she's on her feet, in the evenings, bed by bed.
text [ab8c88] = 阿玛兰斯修女漏掉了晚间巡房，这是谁都记不起来的头一回。在她重新站起来之前，总得有人在傍晚撑起医务室，一张床一张床地照看。

@clue lead_red_ink
# en: Red ink
thread [77bee0] = 红墨水
# en: Two sets of marks
name [2509f5] = 两种批改
# en: Someone is marking your essays a second time, in red ink and unsigned, and leaving them on the lecture tower stair. They expect the next draft there too.
text [e6641c] = 有人在用红墨水重新批改你的论文，不署名，批完就放在讲堂塔的楼梯上。他们等着下一稿也放在那里。

@clue lead_late_bloomer
# en: The sweet shop's daughter
thread [056316] = 糖果铺的女儿
# en: Blue candles
name [3833d3] = 蓝色的蜡烛
# en: The sweet shop owner's grown daughter makes candles flare when she's upset, and nobody at home knows what to do about it. You're the one from the castle, and she'll be waiting when you're next home.
text [af2c92] = 糖果铺老板已经成年的女儿一烦躁，蜡烛就会蹿火，家乡没人知道该怎么办。你是从城堡回来的人，下次回家时她会在等你。
